<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA TO MAKE BONUS SHARE ISSUE.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA TO MAKE BONUS SHARE ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Latvian bank Unibanka shareholders' meeting on Tuesday decided to capitalise the remainder of its profit or 4.98 million lats by issuing bonus shares to be distributed proportionally among shareholders.</p>
<p>The dividend of five santimes and the bonus shares are to be handed by those who are Unibanka's share owners on April 7.</p>
<p>Unibanka has earlier said its audited 1996 profit was 5.978 million lats vs 3.024 in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
